What are these two systems? How do they work? So system one is sometimes called hot cognition. These are all the automatic processes that we are running all the time. And the vast majority of human cognition is hot. When we are walking down the street, when we're picking up a glass, we're not consciously thinking about how to do this. So those are the hot systems.
这两种系统是什么？它们是如何运作的？系统一有时被称为“热认知”。这些是我们一直在运行的所有自动过程。绝大多数人类认知都是“热”的。当我们走在街上，当我们拿起杯子时，我们并没有有意识地思考如何做这些事。所以这些就是“热”系统。

